/T (As documented in the internship certificate, the workflow broadly proceeds from internal data repositories, through a data cleaning and pre-processing stage, into exploratory analysis, machine learning-based scoring, an automated pipeline layer, and finally into a dashboard layer for stakeholder consumption. )
